# ot_emu instrumentation for the KYOTI load audit (reference/handoffs/KYOTI_LOAD_AUDIT.md).
# Base: octabam 36a056c5, tools/emu/ot_emu. Apply in a SCRATCH octabam copy only.
# Env: OT_SW_EXTRA="core:start:stop,..." + OT_SW_OUT (stopwatches: every pair, instructions and
#      datasheet cycles); OT_IPL_OUT2 (ColdFire instructions per interrupt level); OT_ISR_OUT /
#      OT_TICK_OUT (per-episode instruction counts at IPL>=5 / IPL 2); OT_IPL_FROM (start count);
#      OT_TRIPWIRE=1 (last 256 PCs when the PC enters >=0xC0000000); OT_TRIP_PC + OT_TRIP_MAX;
#      OT_RW="lo,hi;..." + OT_RW_OUT (every data read in those ranges, counted per address and PC).
